name=Liquidy Animation Module
version=1.2
versionCode=3
author=janhurn9400
description=Lets the Liquidy launcher open apps with its own animation (apps grow out of their icon). Android only allows this for system apps, so the module adds the installed Liquidy app as a system app. Changes nothing else. Source: github.com/janhurn9400/liquidy
